text":"Add distributed tracing with context propagation across the library. Every public method must create a child span under the caller's trace context if one is provided. Spans must record the cache name, key, outcome, and byte sizes as attributes. Async eviction must propagate the originating trace context into its background work. The tracing backend must be swappable (i.e. the library must not hard-depend on any specific tracing SDK). Trace context must flow correctly across actor hops without leaking between unrelated concurrent operations."}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.f10; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=a610e;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a concise, sentence-case title (3-7 words) that captures the main topic or goal of this coding session. The title should be clear enough that the user recognizes the session in a list. Use sentence case: capitalize only the first word and proper nouns.\n\nReturn JSON with a single \"title\" field.\n\nGood examples:\n{\"title\": \"Fix login button on mobile\"}\n{\"title\": \"Add OAuth authentication\"}\n{\"title\": \"Debug failing CI tests\"}\n{\"title\": \"Refactor API client error handling\"}\n\nBad (too vague): {\"title\": \"Code changes\"}\nBad (too long): {\"title\": \"Investigate and fix the issue where the login button does not respond on mobile devices\"}\nBad (wrong case): {\"title\": \"Fix Login Button On Mobile\"}"}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"c50e88c830c8acad53e140253de1ecd562e8e2d53f8dd90059f4cf32f2a46495\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"b695fd8b-199b-44d6-bd57-28b489dc6bd8\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["title"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]31:13:Authorization,10:[REDACTED],]36:12:Content-Type,16:application/json,]51:10:User-Agent,33:claude-cli/2.1.92 (external, cli),]68:24:X-Claude-Code-Session-Id,36:b695fd8b-199b-44d6-bd57-28b489dc6bd8,]28:16:X-Stainless-Arch,5:arm64,]25:16:X-Stainless-Lang,2:js,]26:14:X-Stainless-OS,5:Linux,]40:27:X-Stainless-Package-Version,6:0.80.0,]31:23:X-Stainless-Retry-Count,1:0,]30:19:X-Stainless-Runtime,4:node,]41:27:X-Stainless-Runtime-Version,7:v24.3.0,]29:19:X-Stainless-Timeout,3:600,]173:14:anthropic-beta,150:interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14,redact-thinking-2026-02-12,context-management-2025-06-27,prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05,structured-outputs-2025-12-15,]52:41:anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access,4:true,]35:17:anthropic-version,10:2023-06-01,]26:9:x-api-key,10:[REDACTED],]14:5:x-app,3:cli,]28:10:Connection,10:keep-alive,]28:4:Host,17:api.anthropic.com,]46:15:Accept-Encoding,23:gzip, deflate, br, zstd,]25:14:Content-Length,4:2034,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}6:backup;0:~17:timestamp_created;18:1775468423.0874197^7:comment;0:;8:metadata;0:}6:marked;0:;9:is_replay;0:~11:intercepted;5:false!11:server_conn;4102:3:via;0:~19:timestamp_tcp_setup;18:1775468423.1141136^7:address;27:17:api.anthropic.com;3:443#]19:timestamp_tls_setup;18:1775468423.1624973^13:timestamp_end;0:~15:timestamp_start;18:1775468423.0885146^3:sni;17:api.anthropic.com;11:tls_version;7:TLSv1.3;11:cipher_list;0:]6:cipher;22:TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384;11:alpn_offers;0:]4:alpn;0:,16:certificate_list;3569:1318:-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
